# ==================================================================================================
# NEVER COMMIT SIGNING CERTIFICATES, KEYS OR CREDENTIAL FILES
#
# Visual Studio generates <Project>_TemporaryKey.pfx for sideload signing. It is a private key, it
# is per-developer and disposable, and it must stay out of git - VS recreates it on demand. The same
# goes for any real certificate, SSH key, API-key file or environment file.
# Added 2026-08-07 after KOBrot_TemporaryKey.pfx was found committed and purged from history.
# ==================================================================================================
